<title>POLAND: PLI OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 73,400 LOSS.</title>
<headline>PLI OCT NET SWINGS TO PLN 73,400 LOSS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net loss		 0.07 vs   0.11 profit</p>
<p> Pre-tax loss	   0.12 vs   0.16 profit</p>
<p> Operating loss	 0.31 vs   0.10 profit</p>
<p> Sales		    3.26 vs   4.23</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.86 vs   0.39</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.96 vs   0.55</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.84 vs   0.55 loss</p>
<p> Sales		   31.40 vs  15.78</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish trading company is Polish Life</p>
<p>Improvement SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
